description: Never allow Cursor/cursoragent as git co-author
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor co-author in git

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor` or `cursoragent@cursor.com` to any commit message.
- Prefer `git commit-tree` (or equivalent) when the environment injects Cursor trailers into `git commit`.
- Author/committer must remain the repo owner (`SwagRee`) only.
- If a commit message contains a Cursor trailer, reject it and recreate the commit without that line.
